{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_05DD90","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"说到云雾林，三肉垂钟雀，也就是“胡须鸟”也很有名。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"胡须鸟？它还长胡子吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"Snake，跟你的胡子一样哦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":35,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"哈？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"准确来说那不是毛，而是肉垂，不过看上去简直就是胡子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"肉垂？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"嗯，而且只有雄鸟才有。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"很好。胡子可是男人的命。那家伙也生活在云雾林吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"平时生活在低地热带雨林，不过到了繁殖期就会迁往高地云雾林。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"另外，胡须鸟还以叫声特别响亮而闻名。声音是“砰——”“锵——”这种金属般的音色，听起来都不像鸟叫。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":147,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"就连我也不太模仿得出那种叫声。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"看来不会把它和凤尾绿咬鹃搞混了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""}]}